# hapon, "afternoon"; gabi, "evening/night"; tanghali, "noon".  All three fix
# their hour in the PM half: "alas kuwatro y medya ng hapon" == 16:30, "alas
# otso y medya ng gabi" == 20:30, "alas dose ng tanghali" == 12:00.  gabi is a
# plain PM marker, not a midnight-crossing band: CLDR fil runs it from 16:00
# to 24:00 and gives the small hours to umaga/madaling-araw instead, so it
# never has to name a 1am.  en.wiktionary.org, hapon; en.wiktionary.org, gabi; en.wiktionary.org, tanghali;
# Unicode CLDR 47, fil; en.wikipedia.org, "Date and time notation in the Philippines".
hapon
gabi
tanghali
